target.value:
(A) One (1) research seminar;
(B) One (1) symposium on maritime security in the GoG; and
(C) 100 maritime experts participating in seminars / symposium

title.narrative:
(1) Eight (8) research papers dedicated to at-risk women in maritime or coastal domains in the GoG developed and published;

(2) One (1) Code of Maritime Practice for Women in the Gulf of Guinea Maritime Domain developed and adopted by at least 7 countries in the Gulf of Guinea;

(3) Four (4) dialogues devoted to women in maritime for an estimated total of 80 participants from West and Central Africa and beyond; and

(4) One (1) Training module for women in maritime security incorporated in the KAIPTC foundational maritime security course.

target.value:
(A) Two (2) published research papers on at-risk women in the maritime or coastal domains.

(B) One (1) symposium on women in maritime security for 20 women;

(C) One (1) High-level consultative seminar for 20 women leaders in maritime security;

(D) One (1) draft Code of Maritime Practice for Women in the Gulf of Guinea Maritime Domain produced in English, and French (and Portuguese, if relevant);
